THIRD-PARTY NOTICES

This project is a convenience wrapper. It does not contain the separation
models themselves; it downloads them at runtime. Please note:

  * audio-separator (python-audio-separator)
    https://github.com/nomadkaraoke/python-audio-separator
    MIT License. Copyright (c) nomadkaraoke and contributors.

  * Ultimate Vocal Remover (UVR) community model weights
    https://github.com/Anjok07/ultimatevocalremovergui
    Each model carries its OWN license. Several community-trained models
    restrict or prohibit commercial use. YOU ARE RESPONSIBLE for reviewing
    the license of any model you download before using it, especially in
    commercial or distributed products.

  * PyTorch        BSD-3-Clause    https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch
  * ONNX Runtime   MIT             https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime
  * librosa         ISC             https://github.com/librosa/librosa
  * FFmpeg         LGPL/GPL        https://ffmpeg.org

Model licenses are the single most common source of legal trouble for
projects like this. Check them before shipping.
